                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b'>Diabetes Risk Score strongly separates healthy, prediabetic, and diabetic groups. Avg. BMI rises sharply among diabetics, linking obesity and elevated HbA1c as key metabolic risk drivers. When Fasting &amp; Postprandial glucose level has impact on insulin level, both Systolic and Diastolic BP has impact on diabetic risk.</run>
