                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#499894'>The dashoboard helps to forecast the risk of diabetes for individual based on the most relevant parameters affecting diabetes risk factors through Machine Learning techniques. The parameters are selected based on Machine Learning Pupeline driven Correlation Analysis using Python.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b'>Tableau uses Analytics Extension Connection feature to connect to a TabPy server where a Machine Learning model is implemented to predict the diabetes probability. The model is implemented using Python Machine Learning Pipeline analyzing Random Forest and K-Nearest Neighbour algorithms with parameter tuning and selected Random Forest with accuracy of 92% for prediction mode.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ea5a16' fontsize='10'>Instruction:</run>
