                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Calibri,sans-serif'>Health history factors such as family history of diabetes and hypertension show moderate influence on diabetes risk in this dataset. Lifestyle factors appear to outweigh genetic or comorbid conditions, although elevated blood pressure still forms noticeable high-risk clusters.</run>
