                  <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7375' id='225' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='5125'>
                    <formatted-text>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#499894'>This dashboard explores how daily behaviors influence diabetes likelihood and how habits affect diabetes risk.</run>
                      <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                      <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Tableau Light'>Lifestyle factors strongly influence diabetes risk, especially Low physical activity and Poor diet. Also, insufficient sleep, and high screen time might increase the likelihood of diabetes. Despite of having no hypertension history, because of sedentary lifestyle might cause high diabetes risk.</run>
                    </formatted-text>
                    <zone-style>
                      <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                      <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
